The source lists an overfilled teaspoon of mixed spice but gives no initial addition step, only optional later adjustment with more mixed spice or herbs. That omission is retained.

::story

Greek Pasta Recipe with sauce made out of feta, stock, cream cheese and other ingredients. Uses mixed spice for special flavour, and is a great dinner or mid-day meal.


